    "detailed_description": "-----------------------------------------------------------------<br><strong>It's time to leave the office.</strong><br>Just open the door in front of you,<br>and make your escape.<br><br><strong>Oh, right.</strong><br><strong>Absolutely do not turn back or try to investigate anything.</strong><br><strong>In that case, I can't guarantee what will happen.</strong><br><br>Got it?<br>-----------------------------------------------------------------<br>About the game<br>This is an instant-death mystery solving mini-game.<br><br>Solve the puzzle and leave the office through the true route...<br>Oops, there\u2019s no such thing.<br>Just leave through the door in front of you after starting the game, and you\u2019ll be fine.<br><br>Recommended play time: 30 minutes to 1 hour<br>-----------------------------------------------------------------<br>\u30fbNote<br>This game is more of a jump scare game (where scary images suddenly appear with loud sounds) than a horror game.<br>While it\u2019s designed with a horror atmosphere, please play it thinking of it as a jump scare genre.<br><br>-----------------------------------------------------------------<br>Regarding streaming<br>I'm moved to tears that you would stream such a game.........................<br>Please Have a fun.<br>I would be even more thrilled if you could attach a link to the Steam page in the description.<br>-----------------------------------------------------------------<br>During the game, pressing the escape key will open the settings, where you can adjust sound volume, mouse sensitivity, and save your game.<br>Since it's just about leaving the office, you might think such settings are unnecessary, but please feel free to use them.",
